    "title": "Woman injured after being hit by vehicle in Walmart parking lot in Florence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jaylan Wright No media credit provided. ,\n10 hours ago\nFLORENCE, Ala. ( WHNT ) — A 78-year-old woman was injured after being hit by a vehicle in a Walmart parking lot in Florence on Wednesday.\nFlorence Police said that the incident happened at the Walmart Supercenter located at 2701 Cloverdale Road around 10 a.m.\nAccording to authorities, the woman was transported to the North Alabama Medical Center for treatment.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHNT.com.",
